WEBVTT

00:43:56.876 --> 00:44:00.916
well, I do think that there will be
knock-on decoupling

00:44:00.916 --> 00:44:03.676
that will be longer term
and more strategic

00:44:03.716 --> 00:44:05.716
from the United States, from the Europeans

00:44:05.756 --> 00:44:08.276
and even from Japan and South Korea.

00:44:08.316 --> 00:44:10.996
So that is a worry,

00:44:10.996 --> 00:44:14.276
and I think the Chinese
are highly aware of that.

00:44:14.316 --> 00:44:17.876
And over the coming months,
they will do everything they can,

00:44:17.916 --> 00:44:21.076
both with the Europeans in particular,

00:44:21.116 --> 00:44:26.676
but also, I expect at least
with some of the Asian economies,

00:44:26.716 --> 00:44:29.236
to try to limit the impact of that.

00:44:29.236 --> 00:44:30.836
Now, keep in mind,